  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "进程拓扑",
      "items": [
        "API Server 与 Task Executor 分离，entrypoint.sh 按 --workers 起 N 个执行器（docker/entrypoint.sh）",
        "执行器自带 worker 回收（MAX_TASKS_PER_WORKER，task_executor.py:198）防 ONNX 内存累积",
        "MCP / Admin / 沙箱执行器为可选进程；Agent 代码在沙箱执行器中运行"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "任务体系",
      "items": [
        "Redis Streams 消费组 + unacked 恢复迭代器（task_executor.py:247-263）",
        "任务行落 MySQL、消息走 Redis；KB 级任务用假 doc_id fan-out（:149-161）",
        "任务类型 13+：dataflow/raptor/graphrag/mindmap/wiki/skill/timeline…（:131-145）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "存储分工",
      "items": [
        "MySQL：document/task/chunk/dialog 等 40+ 表（api/db/db_models.py）",
        "MinIO：文档原件；Redis：队列/缓存/锁；Jaeger：OTel 追踪",
        "检索引擎可插拔：ES / Infinity / OpenSearch（rag/utils/ 连接器族）",
        "延伸阅读：《笔记/01-架构与任务体系.md》"
      ]
    }
  ]
